    "3": {
      "note": "GrepAI lifecycle behavior remains grouped under the provider-owned lifecycle package; retained Docker start/refresh/install implementations do not establish a public provisioning route. Default port vocabulary remains in source. Clone validation explicitly pairs source and target, skips benchmark targets, and applies a no-progress watchdog without a total-duration cap. Identity imports are direct in isolation and shared common helpers, not uniformly direct across GrepAI modules.\n\nAnchor: constants lines 12-17; lifecycle imports lines 12-44; isolation imports lines 10-14; common imports lines 11-15 and 14-20; clone backend-start requests lines 227-254; clone watchdog implementation lines 257-379; default container ports lines 270-283 and 339-360",
